window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c360-f61003dc5f204272.json"]={sha256:"f61003dc5f204272bc6d9f811226acb80b69d801809bad1f006da9224e1f9650",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-685842cdbf8b3df0","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-reconnaissance-orbiter/","title":"Mars Reconnaissance Orbiter — NASA Science","titleEn":"Mars Reconnaissance Orbiter — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c360","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c360","related":[{"id":"c361","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/maven/"],"title":"MAVEN 火星大氣探測","titleEn":"MAVEN Mars atmosphere mission","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學要求拖影不超過 1 像素，長曝光案例需縮短曝光或提出可驗證補償。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: For a teaching limit of one pixel, the long exposure requires shorter exposure or verifiable compensation. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"從兩高度密度估算局部尺度高度，辨認非靜力條件。","differenceEn":"Estimate local scale height from densities at two altitudes and identify nonhydrostatic conditions.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學地面速率 3000 m/s、曝光 0.0001 s、地面像素 0.3 m。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：b=3000×0.0001/0.3。 結果約 1 pixel。固定視向且無補償時拖影像素數=v地面×t曝光/GSD；假設局部速度固定。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成高度差 40 km，低處密度 100、高處 20，密度單位相同。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：H=40/ln(100/20)。 結果約 24.8534 km。等溫靜力近似 n2/n1=exp(−Δh/H)；僅在溫度、成分及重力近似固定時成立。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use teaching ground speed 3000 m/s, exposure 0.0001 s and 0.3 m ground sample distance. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: b=3000×0.0001/0.3. Result ≈ 1 pixel. Without image-motion compensation, smear pixels=ground speed×exposure/GSD, assuming constant local speed.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic altitude difference is 40 km, with lower density 100 and upper density 20 in identical units. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: H=40/ln(100/20). Result ≈ 24.8534 km. The isothermal hydrostatic approximation n2/n1=exp(−Δh/H) requires approximately fixed temperature, composition and gravity.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c370","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/europa-clipper/"],"title":"Europa Clipper 木衛二探測","titleEn":"Europa Clipper","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學要求拖影不超過 1 像素，長曝光案例需縮短曝光或提出可驗證補償。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: For a teaching limit of one pixel, the long exposure requires shorter exposure or verifiable compensation. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"用獨立觀測的面積聯集估算地表覆蓋，避免重疊重算。","differenceEn":"Estimate surface coverage by union of observation footprints without double-counting overlap.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學地面速率 3000 m/s、曝光 0.0001 s、地面像素 0.3 m。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：b=3000×0.0001/0.3。 結果約 1 pixel。固定視向且無補償時拖影像素數=v地面×t曝光/GSD；假設局部速度固定。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成兩幅覆蓋 1200 與 900 km²，重疊 300 km²，目標區總計 2400 km²。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：覆蓋率=(1200+900−300)/2400。 結果約 0.75 fraction。兩次覆蓋聯集 A∪B=A+B−交集；不能用單純總和估完整度。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use teaching ground speed 3000 m/s, exposure 0.0001 s and 0.3 m ground sample distance. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: b=3000×0.0001/0.3. Result ≈ 1 pixel. Without image-motion compensation, smear pixels=ground speed×exposure/GSD, assuming constant local speed.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic footprints cover 1200 and 900 km² with 300 km² overlap inside a 2400 km² target. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Coverage=(1200+900−300)/2400. Result ≈ 0.75 fraction. For two footprints, union=A+B−intersection; their sum is not completeness.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-4a5951be147cd4e9","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/maven/","title":"MAVEN Mars atmosphere mission — NASA Science","titleEn":"MAVEN Mars atmosphere mission — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-08ed3d8e7ae15873","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/europa-clipper/","title":"Europa Clipper — NASA Science","titleEn":"Europa Clipper — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
